guide-entry-ps-core = Core Rules
guide-entry-ps-roleplay = Roleplay Rules
guide-entry-ps-specific = Specific Rules

guide-entry-ps-core-0 = 0. Admins have a final say.
guide-entry-ps-core-1 = 1. Avoid being a negative influence on others experience.
guide-entry-ps-core-2 = 2. No hate speech or discriminatory language.
guide-entry-ps-core-3 = 3. No sexual content, including erotic roleplay (ERP) and no shock content.
guide-entry-ps-core-4 = 4. Players need to be and act the age of 16+.
guide-entry-ps-core-5 = 5. Don't attempt to evade bans, and don't use alt accounts or share accounts.
guide-entry-ps-core-6 = 6. Don't exploit the game, use cheats, or macros.
guide-entry-ps-core-7 = 7. Don't misuse, abuse or ignore admin messages.
guide-entry-ps-core-8 = 8. Only use English.
guide-entry-ps-core-9 = 9. No EORG - Do not grief protected areas

guide-entry-ps-rp-1 = 1. Don't act like an antagonist unless the game says you are one.
guide-entry-ps-rp-2 = 2. As a crew-aligned non-antagonist, follow reasonable escalation.
guide-entry-ps-rp-3 = 3. Don't interfere with players joining, leaving, or ending the round.
guide-entry-ps-rp-4 = 4. You are expected to roleplay without breaking immersion.
guide-entry-ps-rp-5 = 5. Don't use information gained outside of in-character means.
guide-entry-ps-rp-6 = 6. Do not metagame; Obey the Metashield.
guide-entry-ps-rp-7 = 7. Don't give unfair treatment based on who is playing a character.
guide-entry-ps-rp-8 = 8. Listen to your team leader and don't abandon your role.

guide-entry-ps-s-1 = 1. Silicons must follow their laws.
guide-entry-ps-s-2 = 2. Familiars must obey their master.
guide-entry-ps-s-3 = 3. Security and Command must be competent, with positive impact.
guide-entry-ps-s-4 = 4. Antagonists must follow antag-specific rules, with limited impact.
guide-entry-ps-s-5 = 5. Free agents must follow FA-specific rules, with limited impact.

